Z||000000||Uaana||05-19-2000||02:25 AM||||Went in yesterday to have a headlight replaced at a local Champion (it was raining and I didn't feel like getting wet, and I'm lazy)But I digress, been tipping a few...<BR>Told the Mech that the new headlight was under the front hood and he says "I know where it goes but where is the replacement?"<BR>And he says "where next to the engine?" after I popped the hood and showed him he got the idea... Good thing it was only the head light and not something like plugs or an air filter...<BR>BTW we need a confused smiley face for these.<BR>||||reg||1
