Z||000002||lennyb4||05-19-2000||02:49 PM||||Going to Florida to see family last month we (me & the boss aka Wife) stoped at some off road truck stop just outside of Georgia. Well the guy asked if i wanted a fill up and for him to check the oil. I said sure.....Well i come back out from the head to find him standing with the front lid open scratching his head.. He asked me where they put the motors in them there european cars. I lost it right there...laughed so hard i was literally crying..||||reg||1
Z||000003||Homicidal||05-20-2000||04:02 AM||||"Dag nabit.....I say, I say, I say where they might put these motors in these new fangled in-stru-ments.  Dang "I-taliens."  Best call Pa over.  HEY PA GET ON OVER HERE!!!!"<P>"Whats all the ruckus about son?"<P>"I say, I say, I say where you might think these there motors be?"<P>"I reckon it don't have one.  Just runs on air or elec-tri-city."<P>"I reckon so."||||reg||1
